.DS_Store

# ml/ is in the build context because the reader image is built from ml/Dockerfile with the repository
# root as its context. Only four .py files and the exported model are ever copied out of it, so
# everything below would be uploaded to the daemon on every build and used by neither image. The venv
# alone is 909MB — it has torch in it, which is exactly what the reader image exists not to install.
ml/.venv
ml/data
ml/runs/*.pt
ml/__pycache__
